# This class runs on Linux. A CRLF checkout turns the shebang in install.sh into
# /bin/bash\r, and bash reports "bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M" - which tells you
# nothing about the real cause. Force LF on every text file, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.zip  -text
*.png  -text
*.jpg  -text
